AUDIO: 'Hey, how\'s it going? I\'m Rick, the CTO and co-founder here at Directus, and join here with me is Ben Haynes, the CEO and founder of Directus. And we\'re here to talk about something new that we\'ve been working on. Ben? &gt;&gt; Yeah. Uh so you may be familiar with uh'

[00:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the Directus product that we\'ve been building over the past few decades. Uh and that is really here to help turn database content into something that you can build with. Uh that comes from our agency background where we were building'

