VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'front-end deliverables uh for clients and smaller teams. Uh they needed that consistent, powerful back-end to complement the front-end uh for the apps, tools, websites, uh all the things that we were building for them.'

[00:44] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Uh we have taken that headless CMS uh that goes out and powers those highly tailored websites and digital experiences uh and actually use that to become subject matter experts in database abstraction, introspection,'

